# Shared map style (`shared/map-style.ts`)

Single source of truth for map layer configuration used by FE preview and processor rendering.

## Layer keys (UI toggles)

`landForest`, `snow`, `sand`, `rock`, `wetland`, `water`, `streets`, `airports`, `rail`, `buildings`, `streetNames`

Grouped for the FE via `MAP_LAYER_GROUPS` (land / water / transport / settlement / labels).

**Empty fill:** `MapLayerStyle.baseFill` — stripe / projection empty space; when Water is off, also paints water geometry (seas). Helpers: `getBaseFillLayer` / `getBaseFillColor` / `withBaseFillLayer` / `getWaterPaintColor`.

**Base land fill:** `MapLayerStyle.landFill` — continents / shore (MapLibre + SVG canvas while land is on, open landcover, globe silhouette). Helpers: `getLandFillLayer` / `getLandFillColor` / `withLandFillLayer` / `getMapCanvasColor`. `ensureBaseFill` validates both selects.

**Land:** visibility toggle. **Water:** off does not hide seas — recolors them to Empty fill; labels still hide.

**Natural landcover toggles:** `snow` (OMT `ice`), `sand`, `rock`, `wetland`.

**Transport:** `streets` (roads), `airports` (OMT `aeroway` + `aerodrome_label`), `rail` (rail / transit subclasses). UI order: streets → airports → rail.

## Zoom bands (`OSM_ZOOM`)

Developer-defined (not user-editable). Keep `container/tile_render.py` constants in sync.

| Feature | Zoom |
|---|---|
| Built-up (`landuse`) | z10+ (`builtUpMin`; follows Buildings toggle) |
| Buildings | z12+ |
| Airports (`aeroway` / IATA) | z10+ (`aerowaysMin`) |
| Place labels | cities z3+; towns z6+; villages z9+; suburbs z11+ (FE overzooms suburbs at Leaflet z11 / ML z10) |
| Water labels | z9+ |
| Waterway labels | z10+ |
| Park labels | z11+ |
| Highway refs | z8+ (D1, R7, …) |
| Street labels | z11+ (OMT: major named roads at z11; local/`minor` denser from z12) |

## Key exports

- `DEFAULT_MAP_LAYERS` / `createDefaultMapLayers()` — UI defaults
- `MAP_LAYER_GROUPS` / `layerZoomHint(key)` — FE controls grouping + captions
- `OSM_STYLE_LAYERS` — typed OSM → MapLibre registry (`OsmStyleLayerDef`)
- `buildMapStyle(layers)` — MapLibre GL style JSON (OpenFreeMap vector tiles)
- `buildRenderPalette(layers)` — flat colors for Python tile renderer
- `validateMapLayers(input)` — sanitize API input (hex colors, booleans)

## Rules

- Add new **UI toggles** to `MAP_LAYER_KEYS`, `MAP_LAYER_LABELS`, `DEFAULT_MAP_LAYERS`, `MAP_LAYER_GROUPS`, `RenderPalette.enabled`, and both builders
- Add new **OSM paint layers** to `OSM_STYLE_LAYERS` with `group`, optional `minzoom`/`maxzoom`, and a `style()` builder — do not push ad-hoc layers inside `buildMapStyle`
- Update `OSM_ZOOM` and mirror constants in `container/tile_render.py` when changing visibility bands
- FE imports via `@shared/map-style`; BE imports via relative `../../shared/map-style`
- Keep FE `MapLayerKey` type aligned with shared exports
